{
	"Name": "Teleport - Successful Logins from Multiple IPs",
	"Description": "Detects a user successfully logging in to Teleport from more than 3 distinct remote IP addresses within an hour, which can indicate a compromised account or shared credentials. The addr.remote field is an ip:port pair, so the ephemeral client port is stripped before counting distinct addresses. Adjust the threshold to fit your environment.",
